abstract: >
  A complete research laboratory for solving modular arithmetic 
  equations utilizing Abacus Embeddings, Input Injection, and 
  Bit-Serial Algorithmic Decoders (Scratchpads) to achieve 
  perfect length generalization without external logic modules.
keywords:
  - machine-learning
  - length-generalization
  - abacus-embeddings
  - grokking
  - modular-arithmetic
